          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Today</span><span class="info-stat-val">Kolkata is the capital of the Indian state of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/west-bengal">West Bengal</a> and the largest city of eastern <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/india">India</a>.</span></div>
